  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for ArtEclipse', 'description': 'Primary container for ArtEclipse implementation: A web application designed to teach art through interactive lessons, tutorials, and galleries. The platform focuses on a clean, distraction-free experience, allowing users to learn and practice art techniques efficiently. The site features a minimalist interface with a black and ombre gradient theme, emphasizing visual content and ease of navigation.', 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Interactive Lessons",\n      "description": "Step-by-step art lessons with interactive elements such as drawing tools and quizzes.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Art Gallery",\n      "description": "A curated gallery where users can view, upload, and share artworks.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Minimalist Navigation",\n      "description": "Simple, intuitive navigation with minimal UI elements to keep the focus on content.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "User Profiles",\n      "description": "Personalized user profiles to track progress and save favorite lessons or artworks.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#000000",\n    "secondary": "#2d2d2d",\n    "accent": "linear-gradient(90deg, #000000 0%, #4b006e 100%)"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The UI features a dark background with a subtle ombre gradient (e.g., black fading into deep blue or purple). The interface is minimalist: a top navigation bar with logo and essential links, a central content area for lessons or gallery, and floating action buttons for key actions. Ample whitespace and clean